{
    "title": "Lyrics Star\u30fbSong Lyrics Tiles",
    "description": "Looking for music or piano tapping games?\r\nWelcome to Lyrics Star\u30fbSimply Piano Tiles, where rhythm meets melody in a symphony of musical mastery! Embark on a sensational journey through the captivating world of music, where your fingertips transform into virtuoso instruments, and every tap unleashes harmonious magic. With Lyrics Star\u30fbSimply Piano Tiles, immerse yourself in the addictive thrill of piano gameplay fused with the challenge of lyrical prowess.\r\nDon\u2019t forget to only tap the lyrics tiles.\r\nDive into an expansive collection of music genres tailored to suit every musical palate. From pop anthems to soulful ballads. With Lyrics Star\u30fbSimply Piano Tiles, you can play various types of music and artists: from Billie Eilish to Shawn Mendes, Jonas Brothers, Justin Bieber, Rihanna, Imagine Dragon, Sia and more.\r\n\r\n\r\nGame\u2019s rules:\r\n1. Tap the lyrics tiles.\r\n2. Learn your favorite song\u2019s lyrics.\r\n3. Compete with the best and fastest piano tile players.\r\n4. Play in the rockstar mode or the legend mode.\r\n5. Customize your app\u2019s design.\r\n\r\n\r\nCreate your own account and start competing worldwide.\r\n\r\n\r\nBecome the best pianist now!\r\n\r\nSeason Pass Subscription\r\nSubscribe to enjoy unlimited revives, receive 4 new songs every month, and experience ad-free play for just $6.99 per month.\r\n\r\nAlso get two new additional game play themes.\r\n\r\nPayment will be charged to your Google Play account upon purchase confirmation.\r\n\r\nSubscriptions renew automatically unless auto-renew is disabled at least 24 hours before the current subscription period ends.\r\n\r\nYour account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period, according to the cost of your chosen package.\r\n\r\nYou can manage your subscriptions and disable auto-renewal in your Google Play account settings after purchasing.",
